# ============================================================
#  .gitignore — HARM crop water-stress / GLORIA pipeline
#
#  Keeps code, configs, READMEs and the small shipped reference
#  tables. Excludes all large raw inputs, intermediates and
#  pipeline outputs (each is regenerated by running its stage),
#  plus OS / editor / Python cruft. See each stage's README for
#  how to download or regenerate the ignored data.
# ============================================================

# ---- OS / editor cruft ----
.DS_Store
._*
__MACOSX/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# ---- Python ----
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# ---- Logs (every stage writes ./logs/) ----
logs/
*.log

# ============================================================
#  Not part of the public release
# ============================================================
# Internal handoff notes — not published to the public repository.
/PROJECT_SUMMARY.md

# Author-only analyses (not distributed)
/paper_analyses/

# Raw working notebooks at the repo root (04_data, 00000, Untitled2, …);
# their useful content has been ported into the stages. The stage
# tutorial notebooks (e.g. 01_data_acquisition/tutorial.ipynb) are kept.
/*.ipynb

# Manuscript / paper drafts — not distributed on GitHub (advisor request).
/*.docx
/paperwriting/
/Bioeconomy supply chains redistribute crop water stress_REVISED-1-1/

# Stray copy of the GLORIA release notes at the repo root — not redistributed
# (the canonical reference copy stays in 06_gloria_mapping/reference/).
/GLORIA_ReleaseNotes_060*.pdf

# Large top-level data only used by paper_analyses
/aggregated_all_years.csv
/country/
/country_shape/

# ============================================================
#  Stage 01 — data_acquisition
#  All raw downloads + merged NCs + the 704 MB reference grid.
# ============================================================
/01_data_acquisition/data/

# ============================================================
#  Stage 02 — water_stress_computation
#  Keep AWARE.xlsx / CSVs; drop the 854 MB gridded weights NC,
#  the user-supplied WF inputs and the computed outputs.
# ============================================================
/02_water_stress_computation/aware/aware_gridcell.nc
/02_water_stress_computation/wf/*
!/02_water_stress_computation/wf/README.md
/02_water_stress_computation/waterstress/*
!/02_water_stress_computation/waterstress/README.md

# ============================================================
#  Stage 03 — iha_computation  (~60 GB of data)
#  Keep data/faostat, crop_calendar and validation; drop the
#  downloaded inputs, the regenerated outputs, the SPAM
#  reference, and the unused crop_parameters/.
# ============================================================
/03_iha_computation/data/cropgrids/
/03_iha_computation/data/luh2/
/03_iha_computation/output/
/03_iha_computation/annual/
/03_iha_computation/monthly/
/03_iha_computation/spam2020_reference/
/03_iha_computation/crop_parameters/

# ============================================================
#  Stage 04 — dataset_preparation
#  Keep reference/ and noaa/; drop the assembled parquets.
# ============================================================
/04_dataset_preparation/data/

# ============================================================
#  Stage 05 — harm_model
#  (a stage-local .gitignore also covers these)
# ============================================================
/05_harm_model/data/
/05_harm_model/results/

# ============================================================
#  Stage 06 — gloria_mapping  (~15 GB of data)
#  Keep the small shipped data/*.csv tables and reference/;
#  drop the GLORIA dumps and all regenerated satellite blocks.
# ============================================================
/06_gloria_mapping/data/gloria/
/06_gloria_mapping/data/gloria_satellite/
/06_gloria_mapping/data/gloria_mrio/
/06_gloria_mapping/data/satellite/
/06_gloria_mapping/data/satellite_hybrid/
/06_gloria_mapping/data/weights/
/06_gloria_mapping/data/predictions/
/06_gloria_mapping/data/predictions_country/

# ============================================================
#  Stage 07 — gloria_mrio
#  Drop computed footprint arrays.
# ============================================================
/07_gloria_mrio/output/
/07_gloria_mrio/results/
/07_gloria_mrio/dashboard_data/

# ============================================================
#  Stage 08 — final_dataset
#  Drop the published gridded products (NetCDF/GeoTIFF/CSV).
# ============================================================
/08_final_dataset/final_dataset/

# ============================================================
#  paper_figs — figure code
#  Keep the scripts, config and the small si2 comparison CSVs;
#  drop the rendered figures and the large bundled pipeline
#  outputs (the scripts read these from the stages instead).
# ============================================================
/paper_figs/output/
/paper_figs/*.nc
/paper_figs/aggregated_all_years.csv
/paper_figs/data/figs/
